{"3966930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CyberZ: Energy Wars", "steam_appid": 3966930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/3b7e12a6c767ad2d88aa5a3086546c3f.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the 4000s, humanity's greatest triumph became its greatest curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medicines and vaccines developed to combat devastating epidemics began evolving on their own — rewriting human biology, twisting flesh and bone into something unrecognizable. Those who went untreated were left behind, hollow and feral. The world called them Zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization collapsed. Governments crumbled. Money became meaningless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/4c0ea7a8b3f1e76265939bfc4943e5c8.poster.avif?t=1781615179\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/4c0ea7a8b3f1e76265939bfc4943e5c8.webm?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/4c0ea7a8b3f1e76265939bfc4943e5c8.mp4?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/02dda0ccd210d2e559415a7ff23fe4cd.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ruins of civilization, one thing holds power above all else: <strong>Raw Energy</strong>, the last resource worth killing for. Scattered across devastated cities, abandoned research facilities, and zombie-infested wastelands, energy batteries pulse with the lifeblood of what remains of humanity. Resistance factions, rogue scientists, and Cyber Z warlords all fight to control them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't just fight. You <strong>capture, extract, and dominate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/615ecf635f56d15b59d51bb138e3c7db.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all zombies are equal. The most dangerous among them were once weaponized  implanted with cyber-chips and neural controls by rogue scientists who wanted to use them as soldiers. They broke free. They evolved. Now they fight with terrifying intelligence and cybernetic enhancements, and the parts they carry are worth more than gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/338a1567df657e769a78bf2ded495044.poster.avif?t=1781615179\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/338a1567df657e769a78bf2ded495044.webm?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/338a1567df657e769a78bf2ded495044.mp4?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/e27e97700745b5eeeeb1665b809cfd96.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CyberZ: Energy Wars</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>third-person shooter</strong> built around one brutal loop:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>→ Locate the energy battery. → Fight for control. → Extract before they stop you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match drops you into a war zone where two things matter: your aim and your economy. At the start of each round, spend your earned credits on weapons and gear or save up for something devastating next round.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy System:</strong> Buy your gear at the start of each round. Win fights to earn more. Lose everything if you're not careful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture &amp; Extract:</strong> Locate raw energy batteries across the map, capture the zone, and defend it long enough to complete the extraction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Abilities:</strong> Each fighter comes with unique cyber-enhanced abilities. Chain them with your team for maximum impact raw firepower alone won't win you the battery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Team Play:</strong> Coordinate pushes, hold extraction zones, and counter enemy abilities. Every role matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/3c65a485db2888a55025bf4264559892.poster.avif?t=1781615179\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/3c65a485db2888a55025bf4264559892.webm?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/3c65a485db2888a55025bf4264559892.mp4?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW FEATURES TO BE ADDED</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/822ce29982f25e5177871bd247540776.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/e171c79daa1002b29a7dffd6f6e28e49.poster.avif?t=1781615179\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/e171c79daa1002b29a7dffd6f6e28e49.webm?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/e171c79daa1002b29a7dffd6f6e28e49.mp4?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of team strategy In CyberZ: Energy Wars, Raw Energy isn't just the objective it flows through your team like a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raw Energy on the battlefield is unusable without processing.</strong> To unleash its true power, someone has to pay the price. You must sacrifice your own life support to empower an ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You weaken so your ally may strengthen.</strong> You drop to <strong>50%</strong> while they rise to <strong>150%</strong>. The Overcharged Operator becomes unstoppable — and a high-value target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Protect them. If they fall, the power vanishes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/0099137e42a3c246490586814d32db1c.poster.avif?t=1781615179\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/0099137e42a3c246490586814d32db1c.webm?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/0099137e42a3c246490586814d32db1c.mp4?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a mechanic. It is a pact between teammates — a split-second decision that can turn the tide of an entire round.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust:</strong> You're putting your survival in your ally's hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Priority Targeting:</strong> Enemies will hunt the Overcharged Operator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind Games:</strong> Fake transfers to bait enemy rotations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clutch Potential:</strong> One overcharged push can flip an entire round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Cost:</strong> When do you sacrifice yourself and for whom?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/603230b50a54c8f0ea9ef42532282812.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map tells a story flooded city districts, overrun research labs, collapsed industrial zones, fortified island outposts. Each location holds energy. Each location is a battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment isn't just a backdrop. <strong>It's a weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/c185b66d4f9ec59de991666de0136c81.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI hand-holding. No safety nets. Pure player vs player combat in a world that has already given up on mercy. Build your economy, master your hero's abilities, and extract the energy before the enemy team does or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Energy is power. Power is survival.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How far will you go to extract it?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/3b7e12a6c767ad2d88aa5a3086546c3f.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the 4000s, humanity's greatest triumph became its greatest curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medicines and vaccines developed to combat devastating epidemics began evolving on their own — rewriting human biology, twisting flesh and bone into something unrecognizable. Those who went untreated were left behind, hollow and feral. The world called them Zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization collapsed. Governments crumbled. Money became meaningless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/4c0ea7a8b3f1e76265939bfc4943e5c8.poster.avif?t=1781615179\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/4c0ea7a8b3f1e76265939bfc4943e5c8.webm?t=1781615179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s