tn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/603230b50a54c8f0ea9ef42532282812.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map tells a story flooded city districts, overrun research labs, collapsed industrial zones, fortified island outposts. Each location holds energy. Each location is a battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment isn't just a backdrop. <strong>It's a weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/extras/c185b66d4f9ec59de991666de0136c81.webp?t=1781615179\" width=806 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI hand-holding. No safety nets. Pure player vs player combat in a world that has already given up on mercy. Build your economy, master your hero's abilities, and extract the energy before the enemy team does or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Energy is power. Power is survival.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How far will you go to extract it?</i></p>", "short_description": "CyberZ: Energy Wars is a fast-paced third-person shooter PvP. Every match drops you into a war zone where two things matter: your aim and your economy. At the start of each round, spend your earned credits on weapons and gear or save up for something devastating next round.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/53de2e8a5971668b34264e825230c0ffdd344a78/header.jpg?t=1781615179", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966930/673f9a402b52a11c0e